│ cholesterol (CH) and low-density-lipoprotein cholesterol (LDL-C) levels in the intervention group showed             │
│ nonsignificant trend for a decrease (PFPG=0.084, PCH=0.057, PLDLC=0.098), compared with a significant increase of    │
