=== BATCH SCREENING TASK ===
Review: Interventions for increasing fruit and vegetable consumption in children aged five years and under
Total studies to screen: 100

SELECTION CRITERIA:
We included randomised controlled trials, including cluster‐randomised controlled trials and cross‐over trials, of any 
intervention primarily targeting consumption of fruit, vegetables or both among children aged five years and under, and 
incorporating a dietary or biochemical assessment of fruit or vegetable consumption. Two review authors independently 
screened titles and abstracts of identified papers; a third review author resolved disagreements.

