│ NCT02889198 (retrospectively registered)."}, {"study_index": 409, "title": "Modifying children’s food preferences:   │
│ the effects of exposure and reward on acceptance of an unfamiliar vegetable", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE The aim of this │
