│ children", "abstract": "The National School Fruit Scheme (NSFS) provides one free piece of fruit each school day to  │
│ children, aged 4 to 6 years, attending state schools in England. The aims of the present study were to determine if  │
│ NSFS was associated with a higher fruit consumption in infant school children (4-6 years old), and to assess whether │
